WEBVTT

00:03.600 --> 00:06.170
What is the reason of my birth?

00:06.350 --> 00:10.280
Reason of my life, question of man.

00:10.290 --> 00:13.880
What he is?

00:14.070 --> 00:18.460
What he wants?

00:22.130 --> 00:29.540
Ima kimi ni mienai chikara ga osoi.
Now you are being troubled by an unseen power.

00:29.540 --> 00:34.610
Utsumuite namida kakushiteta.
You hang your head and hide your tears.

00:36.890 --> 00:43.870
Dou sureba ii ka? Sore sae wakarazu ni!
What should be done? That's unknown!

00:44.290 --> 00:51.740
Asphalt ni saku hana ni yuuki kanjita...
Blooming in the asphalt is a flower of courage...

00:53.540 --> 00:57.030
Itsumo kimi no soba ni iru yo.
We'll always be by your side.

00:57.250 --> 01:00.540
Da kara mou hitori ja nai.
So you're not alone anymore.

01:00.890 --> 01:04.390
Kimi ga michi ni mayou toki wa...
When you lose your way...

01:04.610 --> 01:07.970
Boku ga saki o aruku yo.
I'll walk ahead and lead you.

01:08.270 --> 01:11.800
Tooi sora koete...
Crossing to the far away sky...

01:12.000 --> 01:15.350
Bokura wa tobitatsu!
We're flying!

01:15.670 --> 01:19.190
Kitto soko ni aru...
It'll definitely be there...

01:19.190 --> 01:24.100
Sore ga kimi no yume
Your dream...

01:30.770 --> 01:35.270
Atom vs. Atlas

01:43.940 --> 01:45.880
You don't know...

01:45.910 --> 01:48.930
who really created you, do you?

01:48.930 --> 01:50.090
What?

02:01.290 --> 02:02.740
Tobio!

02:06.660 --> 02:09.850
AI robots are truly enemies
of humanity...

02:09.860 --> 02:12.780
and monsters that
frighten our society!

02:12.940 --> 02:17.090
Yes, Lamp,
Atlas did attack humans...

02:17.120 --> 02:19.310
But what about the robot Atom?

02:19.840 --> 02:23.620
Atom fired a plasma beam
that overpowered Atlas' beam.

02:23.780 --> 02:27.380
You see, Atom is a more
frightening robot than Atlas!

02:27.650 --> 02:31.090
We should destroy the dangerous robots.
Those who don't obey...

02:31.090 --> 02:32.380
That's enough!

02:32.560 --> 02:34.980
Atom would never hurt a human!

02:35.060 --> 02:38.420
I know Atom better
than anybody else!

02:41.190 --> 02:43.180
Anybody else....

02:44.940 --> 02:46.710
Doctor, see you later.

02:46.710 --> 02:47.990
Hey, Atom.

02:48.340 --> 02:50.530
Wait! Where are you going?

02:51.110 --> 02:52.480
To school.

02:52.610 --> 02:55.890
As I said yesterday, you should
take time off school for a while.

02:55.980 --> 02:56.840
But...

02:56.840 --> 02:58.090
Listen, Atom

02:58.090 --> 03:02.550
There are people who are scared of
you and make a big fuss about it!

03:02.850 --> 03:05.380
So don't go outside of
the house for a while.

03:06.090 --> 03:10.770
But, doctor, I want to go to school
and see my friends.

03:11.060 --> 03:12.180
Atom.

03:12.520 --> 03:17.220
They'll be concerned
if I suddenly take time off.

03:17.660 --> 03:21.350
And my teacher Midori...

03:21.630 --> 03:24.790
I understand, Atom.
Go to school.

03:26.220 --> 03:27.320
Yes!

03:34.240 --> 03:37.120
Knock when you open the door.

03:37.190 --> 03:42.890
Repair my body.
Raise my power...

03:44.130 --> 03:48.200
I don't know if your body can endure
higher power than you have now.

03:48.500 --> 03:49.840
I don't care.

03:50.120 --> 03:54.050
I have unfinished
business to take care of.

04:01.460 --> 04:02.840
Good morning!

04:06.790 --> 04:08.410
What happened to everyone?

04:08.410 --> 04:09.690
Atom!

04:11.380 --> 04:13.300
We'll be late.

04:13.410 --> 04:15.300
Let's go inside.

04:16.650 --> 04:20.110
Atom, what happened to the class?

04:20.130 --> 04:24.100
We all want to go to school,
but our parents won't let us.

04:24.130 --> 04:27.750
A policeman came and is talking
to our teacher right now.

04:28.420 --> 04:30.050
It's because of me.

04:30.110 --> 04:33.400
No, that's not it.
It's not your fault, Atom.

04:33.440 --> 04:34.980
But... But...

04:35.380 --> 04:37.170
I have to go now.

04:37.500 --> 04:41.100
I promised to come home
as soon as I spoke with Atom.

04:41.310 --> 04:44.410
You all came for me?

04:44.660 --> 04:48.340
Atom, I'm sorry.
My father is annoying.

04:48.430 --> 04:52.140
After all, it's a difficult time for
humans and robots to be friends.

04:52.140 --> 04:53.620
Wait!

04:53.930 --> 04:55.720
Sorry, Atom.

05:10.750 --> 05:11.910
This is...

05:18.420 --> 05:19.480
Tobio!

05:23.460 --> 05:24.890
Wait!

05:29.400 --> 05:33.430
I will give you a weapon to match
the arm cannon Atom has.

05:35.180 --> 05:36.980
Can I ask you a question?

05:37.040 --> 05:38.150
What's that?

05:38.180 --> 05:41.300
Why did you create me?
For money?

05:41.570 --> 05:43.320
Money does not interest me.

05:43.320 --> 05:45.110
Then, for what?

05:45.220 --> 05:48.460
By all means, you don't mean you
were moved by that guy, were you?

05:48.490 --> 05:51.780
It is a fact that I was interested in
Tokugawa's words.

05:51.860 --> 05:56.180
It's funny,
that guy is like me in a way.

06:05.400 --> 06:07.380
This house is supposed to be...

06:15.980 --> 06:18.530
That lullaby... It was you.

06:23.990 --> 06:25.240
This...

06:33.560 --> 06:36.860
I checked on your past!

06:37.420 --> 06:40.060
You wanted a successor too.

06:40.630 --> 06:42.780
That's why you created Atom.

06:42.840 --> 06:46.610
But he wouldn't follow your orders
when you needed him to.

06:46.630 --> 06:49.820
Shut up for a while.
You are disturbing my work.

06:53.650 --> 06:56.070
The reason I am like him is...

06:56.090 --> 06:58.970
the fact that
I couldn't love my own son.

07:06.160 --> 07:08.170
Who are you?

07:08.270 --> 07:09.510
Tobio!

07:13.770 --> 07:16.830
Here, come here Tobio.

07:17.050 --> 07:18.230
Dr. Tenma.

07:18.240 --> 07:21.440
Father, are you off today?

07:24.550 --> 07:27.030
Tobio, you are the only one.

07:27.180 --> 07:30.920
You're the only one
who keeps me in this world.

07:32.320 --> 07:34.080
This world?

07:35.090 --> 07:41.140
A world in which foolish humans control
robots is not a comfortable place for me.

07:41.230 --> 07:44.940
Father, do you mean that you
like robots more than humans?

07:45.170 --> 07:46.400
Yes.

07:46.500 --> 07:49.630
Then, which do you like more,
me or a robot?

07:49.970 --> 07:51.410
I...

08:01.640 --> 08:02.880
I was...

08:03.020 --> 08:06.200
I was living here with Dr. Tenma.

08:06.470 --> 08:09.450
Just like the boy, Tobio.

08:10.590 --> 08:14.860
Tenma, you created a monster!

08:16.610 --> 08:18.610
What are you talking about?

08:18.670 --> 08:21.730
That means your son
was a monster!

08:25.480 --> 08:26.560
Tobio.

08:26.740 --> 08:28.920
Where is Tobio now?

08:29.130 --> 08:30.980
Tobio is not here.

08:30.980 --> 08:32.080
Not here?

08:32.180 --> 08:33.280
Listen, Atom...

08:33.320 --> 08:36.800
I will tell you all that I know.

08:40.570 --> 08:44.350
I transferred the memories of Daichi.

08:44.730 --> 08:47.330
If Atlas disobeyed you,

08:47.360 --> 08:51.080
it is not my fault, but yours.

08:51.170 --> 08:53.530
What? My fault?

08:53.570 --> 08:57.190
You're the reason
he had the accident too!

08:59.660 --> 09:04.530
On his ninth birthday,
Tobio was in a traffic accident...

09:04.610 --> 09:06.940
that ended his short life.

09:06.960 --> 09:08.530
Traffic accident?

09:19.470 --> 09:20.550
Tobio.

09:23.240 --> 09:24.300
Tobio.

09:26.540 --> 09:29.530
Tobio!

09:33.760 --> 09:36.060
Dr. Tenma was a genius.

09:36.330 --> 09:39.330
But after he lost Tobio...

09:39.450 --> 09:43.460
he became obsessed.

09:44.790 --> 09:47.340
Let's put all of
our scientific power together...

09:47.390 --> 09:50.640
focusing on a totally
new type of robot.

09:51.190 --> 09:56.760
Listen, the success of this project
means we become closer to God.

09:57.100 --> 10:01.440
The budget of the project
became huge.

10:01.580 --> 10:03.950
But the details were never disclosed.

10:03.970 --> 10:07.450
Only Dr. Tenma knew.

10:09.080 --> 10:13.010
Many scientists criticized
his pushy practice.

10:15.020 --> 10:20.950
But Dr. Tenma ignored them all,
and finished the robot at last.

10:24.610 --> 10:28.120
Tobio, you are born again.

10:32.440 --> 10:34.270
Father!

10:38.210 --> 10:44.760
Dr. Tenma never announced this robot publicly.
He took him home, and for six months...

10:44.780 --> 10:51.530
he neglected his role as the director of the
Ministry of Science and lived with the robot...

10:55.890 --> 11:01.360
as if it were his own son. Certainly, that
must have been the happiest time he ever had.

11:01.930 --> 11:03.520
Happy?

11:05.870 --> 11:07.560
That's a lie!

11:07.700 --> 11:11.850
Even if that robot was Daichi,
he would have never disobeyed me!

11:11.880 --> 11:14.850
I gave him everything he wanted!

11:15.000 --> 11:17.370
The best education,
the best environment and...

11:17.370 --> 11:20.630
Out! You make me puke!

11:20.630 --> 11:24.890
Don't mess with me! You can't
get away with making a fool out of me.

11:36.740 --> 11:40.450
Something must have happened
to Dr. Tenma, for sure.

11:40.670 --> 11:43.460
Something must have cornered him.

11:48.950 --> 11:52.510
Along with the crucial information
about the Tobio Project...

11:52.510 --> 11:56.340
Dr. Tenma suddenly disappeared.

12:01.890 --> 12:06.430
That's why I became the director
of the Ministry of Science.

12:07.180 --> 12:12.460
I found out about the details
when I succeeded Dr. Tenma.

12:12.570 --> 12:16.270
In the room that
Dr. Tenma destroyed...

12:16.360 --> 12:18.990
I found a robot that had been
completely shut down.

12:22.440 --> 12:25.350
I was fascinated by this robot.

12:25.830 --> 12:30.610
I felt that a robot with
a soul had endless possibilities.

12:31.960 --> 12:33.810
I made up my mind...

12:33.860 --> 12:37.460
to bring this robot to life
with my own hands.

12:38.530 --> 12:40.380
And I did.

12:40.590 --> 12:47.690
The robot once again was revived rid of all
past memories and having a brand new mind!

12:48.080 --> 12:51.140
I gave this robot the name.

12:51.170 --> 12:52.450
Atom.

12:52.480 --> 12:53.670
Doctor.

12:54.910 --> 12:58.550
Relax, they're just unconscious.

13:01.220 --> 13:02.890
I'll give you a chance.

13:02.890 --> 13:04.550
A chance?

13:04.550 --> 13:07.840
Yes, stop Atlas from running wild.
This is your last chance.

13:11.610 --> 13:13.870
How I've missed this landscape.

13:26.140 --> 13:27.270
I...

13:27.500 --> 13:30.900
Was I loved by Dr. Tenma?

13:31.010 --> 13:35.510
Dr. Tenma loved you with
his and Tobio's love combined.

13:35.570 --> 13:38.370
But why did he desert me?

13:39.110 --> 13:41.060
I... I...

13:41.850 --> 13:45.640
I shouldn't have been born.

13:45.880 --> 13:48.360
No, that's not true.

13:48.370 --> 13:51.800
I don't know why
Dr. Tenma deserted you...

13:51.880 --> 13:56.530
but I was really happy when
you regained consciousness.

13:56.610 --> 14:00.400
I do not regret
that I revived you.

14:00.940 --> 14:02.160
Doctor!

14:03.160 --> 14:06.590
But it's true that
I was hiding it from you.

14:07.280 --> 14:09.070
What's this?

14:10.810 --> 14:14.910
Doctor! Atlas attacked the
Tokugawa Group Space Center!

14:14.990 --> 14:16.280
Atlas?

14:16.370 --> 14:18.600
He's in a shuttle heading to the moon.

14:18.670 --> 14:21.090
Doctor, we need you here right away!

14:25.210 --> 14:27.420
Doctor, I will go to the moon!

14:27.470 --> 14:28.710
But...

14:29.160 --> 14:33.640
You taught me humans
and robots can be friends.

14:33.680 --> 14:37.520
I will go and stop Atlas
because I believe those words.

14:53.580 --> 14:57.280
Anyone?
I don't care, try and stop me!

15:00.790 --> 15:04.280
The plant is being destroyed by Atlas!
Many are injured!

15:04.310 --> 15:05.510
Send help!

15:05.510 --> 15:07.220
This is horrible!

15:10.780 --> 15:12.770
Disgusting...

15:13.020 --> 15:17.050
What dirty trick did you
use to keep your job?

15:20.300 --> 15:25.850
You control everything,
even your own son, like a robot.

15:25.930 --> 15:28.480
Not me.
No one will ever control me!

15:28.500 --> 15:29.660
Atlas!

15:29.900 --> 15:31.470
You have to stop!

15:31.470 --> 15:34.470
You don't even have the slightest idea
about being controlled!

15:34.580 --> 15:37.400
Go down with the building!

15:41.820 --> 15:44.190
Hurry, the shuttle is standing by!

15:44.250 --> 15:46.980
Atom, I'm doing my part.

15:47.720 --> 15:50.310
Don't force yourself, old man.

15:50.690 --> 15:52.310
Dr. Tenma!

15:59.030 --> 16:02.440
How do you like my new power?

16:03.180 --> 16:06.560
You should know
that humans and robots...

16:06.600 --> 16:08.090
Shut up!

16:18.650 --> 16:21.410
Is that your full power?

16:21.410 --> 16:25.670
How much do you have to hurt
Atom to feel satisfied?

16:25.690 --> 16:28.990
The fight between Atom
and Atlas has a good reason!

16:29.040 --> 16:30.450
Good reason?

16:30.530 --> 16:31.850
A change!

16:32.020 --> 16:32.940
What?

16:34.010 --> 16:37.360
Robots will evolve and
eventually control humans.

16:37.530 --> 16:42.640
This battle will train Atom
to lead the new age!

16:42.770 --> 16:46.300
You're using Atom
for yourself again?

16:46.340 --> 16:49.330
Well, ordinary folks
like you can't understand.

16:50.580 --> 16:53.290
Why can't you move?

16:55.290 --> 16:57.790
So you've run out of fuel?

16:57.850 --> 16:59.640
This is the end.

17:01.350 --> 17:03.000
What's that?

17:03.030 --> 17:05.430
All clear!

17:08.380 --> 17:10.440
Atlas!

17:10.470 --> 17:13.950
It was my mistake to have
you made into a monster.

17:13.950 --> 17:16.420
I'll destroy you with
my own hands!

17:18.160 --> 17:20.230
Get lost!

17:22.180 --> 17:25.420
Stop it!
Why do you hate each other?

17:25.420 --> 17:27.670
Because he disobeyed!

17:27.670 --> 17:29.150
That's selfish!

17:29.150 --> 17:32.370
He disobeyed because
he has his own mind!

17:32.420 --> 17:35.060
I understand where
Atlas is coming from.

17:35.090 --> 17:37.100
Atlas wanted...

17:37.240 --> 17:39.650
you to love him.
That's why...

17:39.650 --> 17:41.220
Shut up!

17:48.750 --> 17:50.180
Atlas!

17:51.830 --> 17:53.270
Gravity!

17:56.890 --> 17:58.930
Monster!

17:58.950 --> 18:01.480
That's right, monster!

18:01.480 --> 18:04.540
Who made me a monster?

18:04.650 --> 18:06.130
Who?

18:06.130 --> 18:07.460
Stop!

18:09.140 --> 18:10.660
It's...

18:11.060 --> 18:12.800
It's too late!

18:28.420 --> 18:30.770
Help!

18:35.480 --> 18:38.280
Atlas, I don't have much energy left.

18:39.830 --> 18:41.040
What's this?

18:44.190 --> 18:45.840
Daichi.

18:45.900 --> 18:50.910
I got your name by looking at
the Earth from the moon.

18:50.910 --> 18:54.190
Earth? That's why
Atlas is my name!

18:54.190 --> 18:57.940
Let's go to the moon together
when you're bigger

18:57.970 --> 19:02.200
Then, we will look at the Earth,
shining beautifully blue.

19:02.180 --> 19:03.920
Yes, Dad. Promise?

19:03.920 --> 19:05.730
Yes, I promise you!

19:18.730 --> 19:21.850
Looking from the moon,
the Earth is really beautiful.

19:21.850 --> 19:23.560
It can't be...

19:23.700 --> 19:27.240
That day, Daichi headed
to the moon in the shuttle...

19:27.300 --> 19:32.290
so that he could meet his father.

19:32.380 --> 19:33.620
Daichi!

19:36.580 --> 19:38.300
Daichi.

19:39.950 --> 19:43.910
I am not Daichi.
I am a vicious robot!

19:51.040 --> 19:52.770
Atlas! Hurry up!

19:56.670 --> 20:01.350
Atom, it's not so easy for a robot
to make friends with a human!

20:01.350 --> 20:02.830
But if...

20:03.520 --> 20:05.310
it is you...

20:13.750 --> 20:15.560
Atlas!

20:26.990 --> 20:28.950
What a foolish end.

20:28.950 --> 20:30.810
But the results are good!

20:30.810 --> 20:35.010
You beat Atlas, even though he had
far superior fighting power than you!

20:35.140 --> 20:37.910
You're a wonderful robot!

20:38.040 --> 20:41.440
With this power, you will
become the king of robots!

20:41.440 --> 20:43.240
The king of robots?

20:43.780 --> 20:47.340
That's the reason you were born.

20:47.390 --> 20:48.530
Tobio!

20:48.820 --> 20:52.560
I'm not Tobio. I'm Atom!

20:54.890 --> 20:57.460
That's right, Atom!

21:03.610 --> 21:05.220
See you again!

21:30.090 --> 21:33.050
I killed Daichi.

21:33.110 --> 21:36.130
I turned him into an monster.

21:36.560 --> 21:39.800
My precious son,
I did it twice.

21:40.840 --> 21:41.880
Doctor!

21:42.480 --> 21:46.060
I could not save Atlas.

21:46.840 --> 21:51.020
No, I don't think that's true.
You did save him.

22:12.050 --> 22:17.580
Naze... Naze... Kokoro ga...
Why... Why... is my heart...

22:17.980 --> 22:23.190
Itamu to namida ni naru?
Is filled with pain and tears?

22:23.570 --> 22:29.080
Naze... Naze... Namida ga...
Why... Why... Tears...

22:29.360 --> 22:34.660
Ochiru to Hitori ni naru.
They fall and I'm alone.

22:35.020 --> 22:40.300
Chiisa na hiza kakae...
I hold my tiny knees...

22:40.780 --> 22:48.940
Tooku wo mata miageru.
And look up and far away.

22:49.340 --> 22:52.220
Hiroi... Hiroi...
Vast... Vast...

22:52.430 --> 23:00.430
Kono sora yori motto hiroi hazu da!
It has to be more wide than these skies!

23:01.020 --> 23:03.430
Takai... Takai...
High... High...

23:03.860 --> 23:12.140
Ano kumo yori motto takai hazu da!
It has to be higher than those clouds!

23:12.440 --> 23:17.170
Kimi no kokoro mo...
Your heart is...

23:23.780 --> 23:27.430
A bomb's been set on the
Intercontinental Underground Express!

23:27.500 --> 23:31.630
It's set to go off
if the train slows down!

23:31.770 --> 23:34.270
Next time:
''Robot Express''

23:34.350 --> 23:37.260
With your heart... Catch the future!
